API gaps:
- vector2/3/4_lerp
- vector2/3/4 clamp, component-wise min / max
- vector projection (project a onto b)
- matrix4 TRS constructor (translation + rotation + scale in one call)
- normal matrix helper (inverse-transpose of the upper 3x3)
- quaternion <-> matrix3 conversions
- left-handed variants of the _EXP projection / view functions
- a depth-range option for the _EXP projections: 0..1 (Vulkan/D3D) vs -1..1 (OpenGL)
- consider optional by-value inline variants for small types for expression-style code

Remaining casts (README: prefer no casts):
- HYP_RANDOM_FLOAT casts rand() and RAND_MAX to HYP_FLOAT.

